      }
    },
    "选择重启后保留时，文本和图片保存在用户资料库的 Application Support/Barclip 中。删除应用不会删除这些记录。切换为退出后清空会删除当前磁盘缓存，当前记录仍可使用。旧版缓存迁移后保留在原位置。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When keeping history after restart, text and images are saved in Application Support/Barclip in your user Library. Deleting the app does not delete this history. Switching to clear on quit deletes the current disk cache while keeping current entries available. Migrated legacy caches remain in their original locations."
          }
        }
      }
    },
